+          <span class="journal-badge">Origin & Craft</span>
+          <h2 id="journal-heading">Roaster's Journal</h2>
+          <p class="journal-tagline">Behind every exceptional cup is an uncompromising journey from seed to roast.</p>
+        </div>
+
+        <figure class="journal-figure">
+          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511537190424-bbbab87ac5eb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
+               alt="Selective hand-sorting of high-altitude Arabica cherries"
